       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SIGN1MAIN.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-REC.
           05 WS-AMT     PIC S9(4)V99 SIGN IS LEADING SEPARATE
                         VALUE -12.34.
           05 WS-TAG     PIC X(4)     VALUE "INIT".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           DISPLAY "BEFORE AMT=" WS-AMT " TAG=" WS-TAG.
           CALL "SIGN1SUB" USING BY REFERENCE WS-REC.
           DISPLAY "AFTER  AMT=" WS-AMT " TAG=" WS-TAG.
           STOP RUN.

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SIGN1SUB.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 LK-REC.
           05 LK-AMT     PIC S9(4)V99 SIGN IS LEADING SEPARATE.
           05 LK-TAG     PIC X(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-REC.
       SUB-PARA.
           DISPLAY "SUB SEES AMT=" LK-AMT " TAG=" LK-TAG.
           ADD 1 TO LK-AMT.
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM SIGN1SUB.
       END PROGRAM SIGN1MAIN.
